        }
      ],
      "updated": 1756853300152,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "todos os testes\npercisam estar\nexplícitos para\no mestre",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "todos os testes percisam estar explícitos para o mestre",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "uaZ6fxtklDyo8xCiMUp9b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1741.8797542599737,
      "y": 2345.2785231918624,
      "width": 145.29785827280762,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "dashed",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5r",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 297425262,
      "version": 645,
      "versionNonce": 611510620,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1756942645209,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "se a action\nfor um teste,\na cd precisa\nser setada\nantes de\nabrir",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "se a action for um teste, a cd precisa ser setada antes de abrir",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eOZyA9bOJUhTsfN_lFLGt",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1352.6366921027725,
      "y": 3332.0815515628383,
      "width": 231.53241816778169,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b5s",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 606183730,
      "version": 2947,
      "versionNonce": 1638337628,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "DHt_RH_28MZDRW-YgDEvM",
          "type": "arrow"
        },
        {
          "id": "v6pfUSxL51804e-kMr0NB",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1756864555242,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "o mestre pode setar a\nCD para testes\n(resultado é\nCALCULADO na hora),\neditar as actions que\nachar necessário\n(ex.: adicionar\nvantagem\\desvantagem\npara algum teste,\nremover ou selecionar\nteste adicional à\naction, etc.)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "o mestre pode setar a CD para testes\n(resultado é CALCULADO na hora), editar as actions que achar necessário\n(ex.: adicionar vantagem\\desvantagem para algum teste, remover ou selecionar teste adicional à action, etc.)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
